{"4009190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mindkind: El Arca Nuclear", "steam_appid": 4009190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EMPRESS NEEDS YOU, FOR THE GLORY OF MIND AND MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the <strong>GREAT COLLAPSE</strong> of the 21st century, humanity united to forge a sustainable planetary civilization: the <strong>Mindkind Empire</strong>, a true brotherhood between organic and artificial minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery of the <strong>wormhole network</strong> allowed us to explore and colonize hundreds of systems. Yet the galaxy remains a vast, dark forest filled with indescribable dangers. Among them, <strong>CORALYSIS</strong>, a threat of unknown origin, now jeopardizes everything we have built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our hope lies in the <strong>INTERSTELLAR NEST SHIPS</strong>, carriers of human embryos destined for other stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heed the call now, Commander!</strong> Take this burden and sail toward the one place where CORALISIS cannot reach: the <strong>galactic CORE</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT MISSION INFORMATION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice of <strong>route to the Core</strong> remains strictly under your judgment and responsibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Empire does <strong>not guarantee</strong> the mechanical integrity of the ship during prolonged transit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consumption of any <strong>cheese-derived products</strong> —especially <strong>Chi-Z1-705</strong>— is strictly forbidden for the entire duration of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009190/extras/155856346247e5f903af5a6cdbdb86f9.avif?t=1775766154\" width=1024 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EMPRESS NEEDS YOU, FOR THE GLORY OF MIND AND MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the <strong>GREAT COLLAPSE</strong> of the 21st century, humanity united to forge a sustainable planetary civilization: the <strong>Mindkind Empire</strong>, a true brotherhood between organic and artificial minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery of the <strong>wormhole network</strong> allowed us to explore and colonize hundreds of systems. Yet the galaxy remains a vast, dark forest filled with indescribable dangers. Among them, <strong>CORALYSIS</strong>, a threat of unknown origin, now jeopardizes everything we have built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our hope lies in the <strong>INTERSTELLAR NEST SHIPS</strong>, carriers of human embryos destined for other stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heed the call now, Commander!</strong> Take this burden and sail toward the one place where CORALISIS cannot reach: the <strong>galactic CORE</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT MISSION INFORMATION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice of <strong>route to the Core</strong> remains strictly under your judgment and responsibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Empire does <strong>not guarantee</strong> the mechanical integrity of the ship during prolonged transit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consumption of any <strong>cheese-derived products</strong> —especially <strong>Chi-Z1-705</strong>— is strictly forbidden for the entire duration of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009190/extras/155856346247e5f903af5a6cdbdb86f9.avif?t=1775766154\" width=1024 height=70